ource_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "A parameterised IN list is evaluated per node (1.0 s on the 28k-CI tenant) while UNWIND hits the unique id index (80 ms); the three copies (CI loader, BSM facts, BSM engine) now use the indexed form and the loader flushes on the next macrotask so nested lists never split a batch."}, {"id": "docs_evidence_dashboards_clickhouse_day_alias_defect", "label": "Defect: ClickHouse resolves alias before column in WHERE (toString(day) AS day)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evidence/dashboards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "day >= {from:Date} compared a String with a Date because the alias shadowed the column; day aliases are now d."}, {"id": "docs_evidence_dashboards_orphaned_incidents_after_reset", "label": "Defect: incidents naming business-service CIs recreated under new ids", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evidence/dashboards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The list leaves such orphans out and logs them, and a replay reset now purges incidents, links and impact rows with the estate."}, {"id": "docs_evidence_dashboards_widget_header_overflow", "label": "Defect: one-column widget edit controls overflowed onto the neighbouring card", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evidence/dashboards.md", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Playwright reported the remove button intercepted; the widget header now wraps and cards stop floating while customizing."}, {"id": "docs_evidence_dashboards_estatestats_aggregate", "label": "estateStats dashboard aggregate (one round trip, refreshed every 30 s)", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "docs/evidence/dashboards.md", "source_location": null, "source_u